<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">YouthSafe: A Youth-Centric Safety Benchmark and Safeguard Model for Large Language Models</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Proceedings of the 2025 ACM SIGSAC Conference on Computer and Communications Security; October 13–17, 2025; Taipei, Taiwan</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">Proceedings of the 2025 ACM SIGSAC Conference on Computer and Communications Security (CCS ’25), Oct. 13–17, 2025, Taipei, Taiwan</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3719027.3765168">10.1145/3719027.3765168</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-1525-9/2025/10</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Computing methodologies Natural language processing</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Security and privacy Usability in security and privacy</span></span></span>
